### leaderboard-service — collection HTTP
#
# Requer a stack no ar:
#   docker compose -f infra/docker/docker-compose.yml up
#
# Endpoints exigem um JWT do identity (ADR-0009). O login captura o token.
# GoLand/IntelliJ: clique no ▶. (VS Code REST Client: ver nota no fim.)
#
# Acompanhe: Grafana http://localhost:3000.

@identityHost = http://localhost:8081
@leaderboardHost = http://localhost:8085
@handle = Ranker_1
@password = supersecret
@gameId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@internalKey = dev-internal-key

### (uma vez) Criar a conta no identity
POST {{identityHost}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "handle": "{{handle}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Login no identity -> captura o token
# @name login
POST {{identityHost}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "handle": "{{handle}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.token);
%}

### Submeter um score (highscore: só sobe se for maior) — jogo no header
POST {{leaderboardHost}}/scores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Game-Id: {{gameId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "score": 1500 }

### Submeter um score maior (atualiza)
POST {{leaderboardHost}}/scores
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Game-Id: {{gameId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "score": 2500 }

### Ranking do jogo (top N)
GET {{leaderboardHost}}/leaderboard?limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Game-Id: {{gameId}}

### Meu rank + vizinhos (rank ± k)
GET {{leaderboardHost}}/leaderboard/me?around=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
X-Game-Id: {{gameId}}

# --- Admin (interno) — usado pelo fan-out do session / painel (ADR-0018) ---
# Control plane INTERNO: exige X-Internal-Key, NÃO o JWT. Jogo/jogador no path.

### [admin] Submeter score em nome do jogador (server-authoritative, fan-out)
POST {{leaderboardHost}}/admin/games/{{gameId}}/players/PLAYER_ID_AQUI/scores
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "score": 1234 }

### [admin] Top-N do jogo
GET {{leaderboardHost}}/admin/games/{{gameId}}/leaderboard?limit=10
X-Internal-Key: {{internalKey}}

# --- VS Code REST Client ---
# O bloco "> {% ... %}" é sintaxe do JetBrains. No REST Client, remova-o e use
# Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}
